2026-01-01 an odd run of conversion postings opens the transaction: by quantity
    equity:conversion           -3 X
    a                    3 X @ 2 EUR
    equity:conversion          1 EUR
    equity:conversion          1 EUR
    b                         -2 EUR

2026-01-02 a run of three opens it: by quantity, the amounts play no part
    equity:conversion          1 EUR
    equity:conversion          1 EUR
    equity:conversion           -3 X
    a                    3 X @ 2 EUR
    b                         -2 EUR

2026-01-03 a posting repeats the quantity: by cost
    equity:conversion           -3 X
    a                    3 X @ 2 EUR
    equity:conversion          1 EUR
    equity:conversion          1 EUR
    b                         -8 EUR
    c                            3 X

2026-01-04 at the quantity's places, 3.05 repeats 3.0: by cost
